Parakram,

Do you want it to sound good? You'll need an a2dp stereo headset like 
the hp or the itech clip s.

xmms can currently play voice quality to most mono headsets but the 
software to make any sound app work with stereo is not finished.

bluetooth-alsa.sf.net

Brad

